# Phase transition: pour water into a room and heat it hard.
#
# The reason this script exists is that phase behaviour is the one part of the model Out of Space
# kept, so it is the part most worth being able to re-run here after the split.
new sealed 20 14
latent on
inject 10 7 Water 20000 300
run 20
field species
probe 10 7

heat 10 7 400000000
run 40
probe 10 7
field heat

# Latent heat moves energy into a reservoir nothing counts yet, so totals are NOT expected to
# balance with `latent on` — see FluidlabConfig.latentHeat. What must hold is that the tick never
# fails to charge for it: a non-zero value here is the discretisation admitting it stepped too far.
expect cohesionunpaid == 0
